      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Regression Applications in Finance",
      "source_hash": 13372869680703896230,
      "context_hash": 5033630677075430761,
      "translation": "금융 분야의 회귀분석 응용",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "regression": "회귀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Learning Outcomes",
      "source_hash": 11113196318162301513,
      "context_hash": 15983400475796284440,
      "translation": "학습 목표",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Learning Outcomes": "학습 목표"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "By the end of this section, you will be able to:",
      "source_hash": 5867122528547714790,
      "context_hash": 2981624522530830285,
      "translation": "이 절을 마치면 다음을 할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Calculate the regression model for a single independent variable as applied to financial forecasting.",
      "source_hash": 1337398380202846114,
      "context_hash": 3986171691565373643,
      "translation": "재무 예측에 적용되는 단일 독립변수의 회귀 모형을 계산합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "financial forecasting": "재무 예측",
        "independent variable": "독립변수",
        "regression model": "회귀 모형"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T08:08:06.992592Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Extract measures of <term class=\"no-emphasis\" id=\"term-00001\">slope</term> and <term class=\"no-emphasis\" id=\"term-00002\">intercept</term> from regression analysis in financial applications.",
      "source_hash": 13044129518385198509,
      "context_hash": 4592577088565462203,
      "translation": "금융 응용에서 회귀분석으로부터 <term class=\"no-emphasis\" id=\"term-00001\">기울기</term>와 <term class=\"no-emphasis\" id=\"term-00002\">절편</term>의 측정값을 도출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "regression analysis": "회귀분석"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Regression Model for a Single Independent Variable",
      "source_hash": 15074445443953039515,
      "context_hash": 16714651382623280333,
      "translation": "단일 독립변수의 회귀 모형",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "independent variable": "독립변수",
        "regression model": "회귀 모형"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T08:08:06.992593Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Regression analysis is used extensively in finance-related applications.",
      "source_hash": 1887071143188488991,
      "context_hash": 15968508899418228607,
      "translation": "회귀분석은 금융 관련 응용 분야에서 광범위하게 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "regression analysis": "회귀분석"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568464Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Many typical applications involve determining if there is a correlation between various stock market indices such as the S&amp;P 500, the <term class=\"no-emphasis\" id=\"term-00003\">Dow Jones Industrial Average (DJIA)</term>, and the Russell 2000 index.",
      "source_hash": 1984186260339578171,
      "context_hash": 6616747563810326331,
      "translation": "대표적인 응용 사례 중 다수는 S&amp;P 500, <term class=\"no-emphasis\" id=\"term-00003\">다우존스 산업평균지수(DJIA)</term>, 러셀 2000 지수 등 여러 주식시장 지수 사이에 상관이 있는지 판단하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA",
        "correlation": "상관",
        "stock market": "주식시장"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T08:08:06.992593Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "As an example, suppose we would like to determine if there is a correlation between the Russell 2000 index and the DJIA.",
      "source_hash": 10734495016735195344,
      "context_hash": 1589236440921506175,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 러셀 2000 지수와 DJIA 사이에 상관관계가 있는지 판단하고자 한다고 가정해 봅시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA",
        "correlation": "상관"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568465Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Does the value of the Russell 2000 index depend on the value of the <term class=\"no-emphasis\" id=\"term-00004\">DJIA</term>?",
      "source_hash": 15519575217483767551,
      "context_hash": 8033833191657301590,
      "translation": "러셀 2000 지수의 값은 <term class=\"no-emphasis\" id=\"term-00004\">DJIA</term>의 값에 따라 달라집니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568465Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Is it possible to predict the value of the Russell 2000 index for a certain value of the DJIA?",
      "source_hash": 2313976782883746090,
      "context_hash": 212183840169998823,
      "translation": "DJIA가 특정 값일 때 러셀 2000 지수의 값을 예측할 수 있습니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568465Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "We can explore these questions using regression analysis.",
      "source_hash": 446586496524567450,
      "context_hash": 16227503624095872356,
      "translation": "회귀분석을 사용하여 이러한 질문들을 탐구할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "regression analysis": "회귀분석"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568465Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "<link target-id=\"table-00001\" document=\"m00090\"/> shows a summary of monthly closing prices of the DJIA and the Russell 2000 for a 12-month time period.",
      "source_hash": 5388742101451434462,
      "context_hash": 1380232915303769153,
      "translation": "<link target-id=\"table-00001\" document=\"m00090\"/>은 12개월 기간 동안 DJIA와 러셀 2000의 월별 종가를 요약하여 보여 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568465Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "We consider the DJIA to be the independent variable and the Russell 2000 index to be the dependent variable.",
      "source_hash": 17967732789547228,
      "context_hash": 9474949822737398903,
      "translation": "DJIA를 독립변수로, 러셀 2000 지수를 종속변수로 간주합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA",
        "dependent variable": "종속변수",
        "independent variable": "독립변수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568465Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Monthly Closing Prices of the DJIA and the Russell 2000 for a 12-Month Time Period",
      "source_hash": 18161652564992984887,
      "context_hash": 9918813050477513215,
      "translation": "12개월 기간 동안의 DJIA 및 러셀 2000 월별 종가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:40.568465Z",
      "issues": []
    },
