    {
      "id": "section:4/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "(source: Yahoo!",
      "source_hash": 14222515033350043782,
      "context_hash": 8897963521684241500,
      "translation": "(출처: Yahoo!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Yahoo": "Yahoo"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:16/seg:1",
      "source": "Finance)",
      "source_hash": 5531301441251382991,
      "context_hash": 16968874503409768770,
      "translation": "Finance)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "The first step is to create a scatter plot to determine if the data points appear to follow a linear pattern.",
      "source_hash": 17757522886544931725,
      "context_hash": 15810298676130844763,
      "translation": "첫 번째 단계는 산점도를 작성하여 데이터 점들이 선형 패턴을 따르는 것으로 보이는지 확인하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "data points": "데이터 점",
        "scatter plot": "산점도"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:17/seg:1",
      "source": "The scatter plot is shown in <link target-id=\"fig-00001\" document=\"m00090\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 6563206298235207899,
      "context_hash": 7489162894013685043,
      "translation": "산점도는 <link target-id=\"fig-00001\" document=\"m00090\"/>에 나와 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scatter plot": "산점도"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165249Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:17/seg:2",
      "source": "The scatter plot clearly shows a linear pattern; the next step is to calculate the correlation coefficient and determine if the correlation is significant.",
      "source_hash": 13725052533709872482,
      "context_hash": 15979253002093248443,
      "translation": "산점도는 뚜렷한 선형 패턴을 보여 줍니다. 다음 단계는 상관계수를 계산하고 상관관계가 유의한지 판단하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "correlation": "상관",
        "correlation coefficient": "상관계수",
        "scatter plot": "산점도"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Using the Excel command =CORREL, the correlation coefficient is calculated to be 0.947.",
      "source_hash": 11913583590344971917,
      "context_hash": 17946306278433888221,
      "translation": "Excel 명령 =CORREL을 사용하면 상관계수는 0.947로 계산됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Excel command": "Excel 명령",
        "correlation coefficient": "상관계수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:18/seg:1",
      "source": "This value of the correlation coefficient is significant using the test for significance referenced earlier in <link document=\"m00086\">Correlation Analysis</link>.",
      "source_hash": 5086375834527249825,
      "context_hash": 2085537280416343557,
      "translation": "앞서 <link document=\"m00086\">상관분석</link>에서 언급한 유의성 검정을 사용하면 이 상관계수 값은 유의합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "correlation": "상관",
        "correlation coefficient": "상관계수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "Using the Excel commands =SLOPE and =INTERCEPT, the value of the slope and <emphasis effect=\"italics\">y</emphasis>-intercept are calculated as 0.11 and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1,496.34</mn></math>, respectively, when rounded to two decimal places.",
      "source_hash": 3584656750926734791,
      "context_hash": 4107720873707819759,
      "translation": "Excel 명령 =SLOPE와 =INTERCEPT를 사용하여 소수점 둘째 자리까지 반올림하면, 기울기와 <emphasis effect=\"italics\">y</emphasis>절편 값은 각각 0.11과 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1,496.34</mn></math>입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Excel commands": "Excel 명령"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165250Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "The Excel output is shown below:",
      "source_hash": 10332542005651813779,
      "context_hash": 735857225745280271,
      "translation": "Excel 출력 결과는 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Excel": "Excel"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Scatter Plot for Monthly Closing Prices of the DJIA versus the Russell 2000 for a 12-Month Time Period",
      "source_hash": 3364879281565864426,
      "context_hash": 2041004831644407822,
      "translation": "12개월 기간 동안의 DJIA 대비 Russell 2000의 월별 종가 산점도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA",
        "scatter plot": "산점도"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A scatter plot showing a positive correlation between the monthly closing prices of the Russell 2000 and the Dow Jones Industrial Average stock index values over 12 months. The diagram shows the Russell 2000 index rising from approximately 1,400 to over 2,200, as the DJIA increases from approximately 25,000 to over 34,000.",
      "source_hash": 11824001475213865224,
      "context_hash": 8551947771284939445,
      "translation": "12개월 동안 Russell 2000 지수와 다우존스 산업평균 주식 지수 값의 월말 종가 사이에 양의 상관이 있음을 보여 주는 산점도입니다. 이 도표는 DJIA가 약 25,000에서 34,000 이상으로 상승하는 동안 Russell 2000 지수가 약 1,400에서 2,200 이상으로 상승하는 모습을 보여 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA",
        "correlation": "상관",
        "scatter plot": "산점도",
        "stock": "주식"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T08:08:06.992594Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "(data source: Yahoo!",
      "source_hash": 4383177884284885808,
      "context_hash": 11942836000706326718,
      "translation": "(데이터 출처: Yahoo!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Yahoo": "Yahoo"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Finance)",
      "source_hash": 5531301441251382991,
      "context_hash": 3372490353751559242,
      "translation": "Finance)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Based on these results, the corresponding linear regression model is",
      "source_hash": 365416226027830341,
      "context_hash": 5837625555237246173,
      "translation": "이러한 결과를 바탕으로 한 선형 회귀 모형은 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "linear regression model": "선형 회귀 모형"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Assume the DJIA has reached a value of 32,000.",
      "source_hash": 4381800645889439904,
      "context_hash": 1388420930410669434,
      "translation": "DJIA가 32,000에 도달했다고 가정합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Predict the corresponding value of the Russell 2000 index.",
      "source_hash": 13072270886747169031,
      "context_hash": 15049164064715281242,
      "translation": "이에 대응하는 Russell 2000 지수의 값을 예측하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "To determine this, substitute the value of the independent variable, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32,000</mn></math> (this is the given value of the DJIA), and calculate the corresponding value for the dependent variable, which is the predicted value for the Russell 2000 index:",
      "source_hash": 7565581642610284273,
      "context_hash": 17319697561815579626,
      "translation": "이를 구하려면 독립변수의 값인 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32,000</mn></math>(주어진 DJIA 값)을 대입하고, 이에 대응하는 종속변수의 값, 즉 Russell 2000 지수의 예측값을 계산합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA",
        "dependent variable": "종속변수",
        "independent variable": "독립변수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Thus the predicted value for the Russell 2000 index is approximately 2,024 when the DJIA reached a value of 32,000.",
      "source_hash": 17092543837644678925,
      "context_hash": 1196827046745788594,
      "translation": "따라서 DJIA가 32,000에 도달했을 때 Russell 2000 지수의 예측값은 약 2,024입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "DJIA": "DJIA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Measures of Slope and Intercept from Regression Analysis",
      "source_hash": 4886259437538324106,
      "context_hash": 3557298587907555347,
      "translation": "회귀분석을 통한 기울기와 절편의 측정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "regression analysis": "회귀분석"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "An important application of regression analysis is to determine the systematic risk for a particular stock, which is referred to as <term id=\"term-00005\">beta</term>.",
      "source_hash": 1886637553435630182,
      "context_hash": 861951206927967807,
      "translation": "회귀분석의 중요한 응용 중 하나는 특정 주식의 체계적 위험을 측정하는 것이며, 이를 <term id=\"term-00005\">베타</term>라고 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "beta": "베타",
        "regression analysis": "회귀분석",
        "stock": "주식",
        "systematic risk": "체계적 위험"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A stock’s beta is a measure of the volatility of the stock compared to a benchmark such as the S&amp;P 500 index.",
      "source_hash": 393208142293667372,
      "context_hash": 13848488774155630009,
      "translation": "주식의 베타는 S&amp;P 500 지수와 같은 벤치마크와 비교한 해당 주식의 변동성을 나타내는 척도입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "beta": "베타",
        "stock": "주식",
        "volatility": "변동성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165251Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "If a stock has more volatility compared to the benchmark, then the stock will have a beta greater than 1.0.",
      "source_hash": 7179625713476736116,
      "context_hash": 331423139342369719,
      "translation": "어떤 주식의 변동성이 벤치마크보다 크다면, 그 주식의 베타는 1.0보다 큽니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "beta": "베타",
        "stock": "주식",
        "volatility": "변동성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165252Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "If a stock has less volatility compared to the benchmark, then the stock will have a beta less than 1.0.",
      "source_hash": 1762093907951463437,
      "context_hash": 17807988042171526873,
      "translation": "어떤 주식의 변동성이 벤치마크보다 작다면, 그 주식의 베타는 1.0보다 작습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "beta": "베타",
        "stock": "주식",
        "volatility": "변동성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165252Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Beta can be determined as the slope of the regression line when the stock returns are plotted versus the returns for the benchmark, such as the S&amp;P 500.",
      "source_hash": 3731417575255848906,
      "context_hash": 6751834731992237307,
      "translation": "베타는 주식 수익률을 S&amp;P 500과 같은 벤치마크의 수익률에 대해 도표로 나타냈을 때 회귀선의 기울기로 구할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "beta": "베타",
        "regression line": "회귀선",
        "returns": "수익",
        "stock": "주식"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165252Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "As an example, consider the calculation for beta of Nike stock based on monthly returns of Nike stock versus monthly returns for the S&amp;P 500 over the time period from May 2020 to March 2021.",
      "source_hash": 3650820921687678985,
      "context_hash": 8701598811000290083,
      "translation": "예를 들어, 2020년 5월부터 2021년 3월까지의 기간 동안 나이키 주식의 월간 수익률과 S&amp;P 500의 월간 수익률을 바탕으로 나이키 주식의 베타를 계산하는 경우를 살펴보겠습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Nike": "나이키",
        "beta": "베타",
        "calculation": "계산",
        "monthly returns": "월간 수익률",
        "stock": "주식"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T08:08:06.992594Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "The monthly return data is shown in <link target-id=\"table-00002\" document=\"m00090\"/>.",
      "source_hash": 11913674122648528506,
      "context_hash": 3672227403288624996,
      "translation": "월간 수익률 데이터는 <link target-id=\"table-00002\" document=\"m00090\"/>에 나와 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "monthly return": "월간 수익률"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T07:34:49.165252Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
